  data: {
    LLM: 'In positive contracts, aim for 36+ points. The 5-point cards (SkÃ¼s, XXI, I, Kings) are crucial - there are only 8 of them totaling 40 points. Queens (4 pts) and Knights (3 pts) are also valuable.\n\nTalon selection: Look for packets with kings or high trumps. In Rufer, if the called king is in the talon, you play alone - consider this risk when calling. In Fahren, try to take as few points as possible - even taking zero points is a valid strategy.\n\nAnnouncement timing: Announcing Pagat Ultimo or Uhu doubles their value but commits you to a specific play. Only announce if you have strong position in trumps. In Sechserdreier, with all 6 talon cards, you have perfect information - use this advantage. The risk/reward (+2/-4) means you need a strong hand to bid Sechserdreier.',
    Player: 'In positive contracts, aim for 36+ points. The 5-point cards (SkÃ¼s, XXI, I, Kings) are crucial - there are only 8 of them totaling 40 points. Queens (4 pts) and Knights (3 pts) are also valuable.\n\nTalon selection: Look for packets with kings or high trumps. In Rufer, if the called king is in the talon, you play alone - consider this risk when calling. In Fahren, try to take as few points as possible - even taking zero points is a valid strategy.\n\nAnnouncement timing: Announcing Pagat Ultimo or Uhu doubles their value but commits you to a specific play. Only announce if you have strong position in trumps. In Sechserdreier, with all 6 talon cards, you have perfect information - use this advantage. The risk/reward (+2/-4) means you need a strong hand to bid Sechserdreier.',
